---
import { profileData } from '../data/profile';
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="pt-8 pb-12 border-t border-stone-200 text-center space-y-2 text-xs text-stone-500">
  <div class="flex items-center justify-center space-x-2 sm:space-x-3">
    <span>© {year} {profileData.name} ({profileData.chineseName})</span>
    <span>•</span>
    <span>Hosted on GitHub Pages</span>
    <span>•</span>
    <span>Astro & Tailwind</span>
  </div>
  <p class="text-[11px] text-stone-400 font-serif">
    以严谨致敬学术，以温厚对待生活。
  </p>
</footer>
